===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*mäntü}}, derived from {{m|fi|mäntä||archaic: mixing utensil made of the top of a young pine}}; cognate of {{cog|et|mänd}}; originally the word meant a young pine, and now relatively rare words {{m|fi|petäjä}} and {{m|fi|honka}} were used of the older trees.

